# Bundled Linux delivery binary — a build artifact copied into src-tauri/ by CI
# (both build-tauri jobs) so Tauri's bundle.resources ships it in the installer
# (#246). Never committed — it is the 8.6MB rs-delivery release binary plus its
# sha256 sidecar (which rs-api verifies before uploading it to S3).
/src-tauri/rs-delivery-linux
/src-tauri/rs-delivery-linux.sha256
